5. FAVV / AFSCA (Belgium)                                         source: "FAVV"
================================================================================
Producer:  Federaal Agentschap voor de Veiligheid van de Voedselketen (FAVV) /
           Agence fédérale pour la sécurité de la chaîne alimentaire (AFSCA),
           Belgian Federal Agency for the Safety of the Food Chain
Dataset:   Product recall notices ("terugroepingen" / "rappels") published on
           favv-afsca.be in Dutch and French, discovered through the site's RSS
           feeds and sitemaps. This is website content, not a published open
           dataset.
Licence:   Uncertain. FAVV-AFSCA's open-data terms
           (https://favv-afsca.be/nl/open-data) allow reuse on condition that
           the source and the date of last update are given, and forbid
           suggesting that FAVV-AFSCA endorses the reuse. It has not been
           confirmed that these terms cover the recall notices, which are not
           listed as an open dataset; the website itself states "All rights
           reserved". Many notices are written by the recalling company and
           published by FAVV-AFSCA, which may further limit the rights the
           agency can grant.
Attribution:
           Source: FAVV-AFSCA, favv-afsca.be.
           Last updated: see the "generated" timestamp in public/alerts.json.

