6. Canadian Food Inspection Agency (Canada)                       source: "CFIA"
================================================================================
Producer:  Canadian Food Inspection Agency (CFIA), published through the
           Government of Canada "Recalls and safety alerts" service
Dataset:   CFIA alerts and recalls RSS feed
           https://recalls-rappels.canada.ca/en/feed/cfia-alerts-recalls
           The official open dataset for the same notices is "Recalls and
           Safety Alerts" on open.canada.ca
           (dataset d38de914-c94c-429b-8ab1-8776c31643e3, JSON:
           https://recalls-rappels.canada.ca/sites/default/files/opendata-donneesouvertes/HCRSAMOpenData.json).
           The fetcher reads the RSS feed, not that JSON file.
Licence:   Open Government Licence – Canada 2.0
           https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada
Uncertain: The OGL–Canada is confirmed for the open.canada.ca dataset above,
           but not for the RSS feed this feed is built from. Whether the
           OGL–Canada or the Canada.ca terms and conditions apply to the RSS
           feed itself has not been confirmed.
Attribution:
           Contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence –
           Canada. Source: Canadian Food Inspection Agency.

